Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Shot,,0,0,0,,S00  Before the audio starts (about 2 s of room tone, added in the edit)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.83,Shot,,0,0,0,,S01  Downbeat, before the first line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.83,0:00:09.43,Shot,,0,0,0,,S02  "Hi, grown-ups! Today we're learning how an opt-out works." (regenerated)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:13.14,Shot,,0,0,0,,S03  "Say hello to Little Switch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:19.65,Shot,,0,0,0,,S04  V01 "Hi! I've got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:23.17,Shot,,0,0,0,,S05  "You typed a little question…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:26.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S06  "And an answer hopped on top of it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:30.05,Shot,,0,0,0,,S07  V02 "Yes, but can I please read the page myself?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:34.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S08  "Well, there's a tiny tab marked 'Web'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:37.72,Shot,,0,0,0,,S09  V03 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.28,Shot,,0,0,0,,S10  "You push me down for off…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:39.43,Shot,,0,0,0,,S11  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:41.50,Shot,,0,0,0,,S12  "…so how'd I just return?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.58,Shot,,0,0,0,,S13  "Default on! Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:48.14,Shot,,0,0,0,,S14  "It was there when you woke up…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:51.72,Shot,,0,0,0,,S15  "You can hide it, you can mute it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:55.25,Shot,,0,0,0,,S16  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:58.90,Shot,,0,0,0,,S17  "Default on!" / V04 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:02.51,Shot,,0,0,0,,S18  Flute and scat fill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:10.26,Shot,,0,0,0,,S19  "Now, 'opt-in' means somebody asks you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:17.04,Shot,,0,0,0,,S20  V05 "And 'opt-out' means that no one asked you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:22.56,Shot,,0,0,0,,S21  "And 'default' is the setting that they picked…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:24.18,Shot,,0,0,0,,S22  "…they'll say you picked the same."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:29.14,Shot,,0,0,0,,S23  "Got that? Opt-in, opt-out, default. There'll be a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:31.43,Shot,,0,0,0,,S24  V06 "There's always a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:35.51,Shot,,0,0,0,,S25  "Now your inbox got a helper…" (replaced)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:39.02,Shot,,0,0,0,,S26  "A lawsuit says it flipped itself last fall…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:40.71,Shot,,0,0,0,,S27  V07 "And what's the company say?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:46.18,Shot,,0,0,0,,S28  "That they didn't, and here's the door: / Just a menu, then a menu…" (replaced
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:49.66,Shot,,0,0,0,,S29  "Then the TV got an update in the middle of the night,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:53.12,Shot,,0,0,0,,S30  "And a brand-new tile was waiting…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.40,Shot,,0,0,0,,S31  V08 "Can I delete it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:55.84,Shot,,0,0,0,,S32  "You can hide it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:58.14,Shot,,0,0,0,,S33  V09 "Is that the same?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:00.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S34  "…Next verse!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:05.86,Shot,,0,0,0,,S35  V10 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:08.11,Shot,,0,0,0,,S36  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:18.32,Shot,,0,0,0,,S37  Chorus 2, first three lines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:22.56,Shot,,0,0,0,,S38  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:26.30,Shot,,0,0,0,,S39  V11 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:29.15,Shot,,0,0,0,,S40  "Pop quiz!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:32.22,Shot,,0,0,0,,S41  "There's a blue ring in the chat app…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.22,0:02:34.72,Shot,,0,0,0,,S42  V12 "I'll uninstall it!" / "Nope!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.77,Shot,,0,0,0,,S43  V13 "I'll mute it, then?" / "That's not so bad!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:39.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S44  "Now your phone has got an update…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:44.02,Shot,,0,0,0,,S45  V14 "Where's the 'No'?" / "There isn't one!…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:47.43,Shot,,0,0,0,,S46  "In Australia, office software went up forty-five percent…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.95,Shot,,0,0,0,,S47  V15 "Was there one without the robot?" / "Only once you tried to leave!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:54.71,Shot,,0,0,0,,S48  "Now the school's the place for learning…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:58.33,Shot,,0,0,0,,S49  "So the school said, 'No AI, please'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:01.78,Shot,,0,0,0,,S50  "And the giant said, 'We hear you!'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:07.50,Shot,,0,0,0,,S51  "Take the robot with your search, or else there's no search there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.35,Shot,,0,0,0,,S52  [record scratch, tape rewind]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:14.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S53  "Correction, boys and girls!…" ("Ahem!" isn't sung)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:16.95,Shot,,0,0,0,,S54  V16 "And the answer box on top?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.87,Shot,,0,0,0,,S55  "…That one's 'deeply integrated.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:22.09,Shot,,0,0,0,,S56  V17 "What's that mean?" / "It means it stays."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:25.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57  Final chorus, first line: "Default on! Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:28.70,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57a  "It was there when we woke up…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.30,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57b  "We can hide it, we can mute it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:39.08,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57c  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.78,Shot,,0,0,0,,S58  Last "Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.41,Shot,,0,0,0,,S59  V18 "I've got two sides."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.07,Shot,,0,0,0,,S60  [click] [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:47.53,Shot,,0,0,0,,S61  "…Guess one of 'em was just for show."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:53.41,Shot,,0,0,0,,S62  "And that's how an opt-out works! Join us next week…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:56.68,Shot,,0,0,0,,S63  [pop-up chime] / "Who asked for that?" ("Huh." isn't sung)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:04:00.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S64  V19 "Hey, who wrote this song, anyway?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.81,Shot,,0,0,0,,S65  "An AI did."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:03.94,Shot,,0,0,0,,S66  "…But somebody asked it to."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:14.12,Shot,,0,0,0,,S67  V21 "Hey… was its switch on, too?" over the band's last bars, then the audio e
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:23.12,Shot,,0,0,0,,S68  After fact card G, room tone only
